### List theatres
GET http://localhost:5000/api/theatres?page=1&limit=10

### Search theatres
GET http://localhost:5000/api/theatres?q=Aurora

### Get one
GET http://localhost:5000/api/theatres/theatres-1

### Create (admin token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/theatres
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Galaxy Cinemas",
  "city": "Surat",
  "address": "MG Road",
  "screens": 4
}
